    <x:String x:Key="Backup_RestoreAll">The whole build</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Backup_RestoreAllHint">Brings back worlds, mods, configs and settings. The current state is saved as a separate backup first.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Backup_RestoreNew">As a new build</x:String>
