    <!-- Shared files: one copy on disk for all builds -->
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_SharedFiles">Keep identical mods and packs once</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_SharedFilesHint">A mod, resource pack or shader that several builds have takes disk space once. Removing a mod or a build does not touch the others. The switch only affects new downloads; on a FAT32 or exFAT disk files are kept the old way.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_SharedFilesClean">Free up space</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_SharedFilesCleanHint">Compares mods and packs across all builds, joins identical files into one and removes from the store those no build needs. Nothing is deleted from a build.</x:String>
