    <x:String x:Key="Settings_UsageStats">Anonymous launch statistics</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings_UsageStatsHint">Once per launch the launcher sends the statistics collector a random installation id, the version, the language, the OS, how the update check went and how many times the launcher froze over the week (the number only); after a game crash, the cause, game version and loader. No nickname, files, paths or address are sent. That is how the server owner sees how many people use the launcher and what breaks for them.</x:String>
