    <!-- "Ускорение": the per-build switch that can be switched back off -->
    <x:String x:Key="Boost_Title">Speed-up</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Boost_Hint">Adds the mods that make the game faster without changing how it plays, and lowers the settings that cost frames. It shows the list first. Switch it off and the mods are switched off and the settings go back to what they were.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Boost_ReviewTitle">What will happen</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Boost_ReviewUndo">All of this is written into the build. Switch the speed-up off and the added mods are switched off and the settings return to the values on the left. Anything you change yourself afterwards stays yours.</x:String>
