    <x:String x:Key="HostMods_Configure">Configure</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="HostMods_ConfigureHint">Configure opens the mod's settings files right in the launcher: labelled fields where the file allows it, plain text otherwise.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="HostMods_ToggleTip">Switch on or off. A switched-off mod stays in the folder and the server does not load it.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="HostMods_Remove">Take off the server</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="HostMods_RemoveQuestion">Take “{0}” off the server? The file is moved into the .removed folder inside the server's folder and can be put back from there.</x:String>
